{"book":"hono","chapter":"middleware-builtin","chapterTitle":"الوسائط المدمجة","slug":"secure-headers","title":"وسيط الرؤوس الآمنة","headings":[{"depth":2,"id":"import","text":"Import"},{"depth":2,"id":"الاستخدام","text":"الاستخدام"},{"depth":2,"id":"الخيارات-المدعومة","text":"الخيارات المدعومة"},{"depth":2,"id":"تعارض-البرمجيات-الوسيطة","text":"تعارض البرمجيات الوسيطة"},{"depth":2,"id":"ضبط-content-security-policy","text":"ضبط Content-Security-Policy"},{"depth":3,"id":"nonce-السمة","text":"nonce السمة"},{"depth":2,"id":"ضبط-permission-policy","text":"ضبط Permission-Policy"}],"html":"<p>يبسّط وسيط الترويسات الآمنة (Secure Headers Middleware) إعداد ترويسات الأمان. مستوحى جزئيًا من قدرات Helmet، يتيح لك التحكم في تفعيل وتعطيل ترويسات الأمان المحددة.</p>\n<h2 id=\"import\">Import</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { secureHeaders } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono/secure-headers&#x27;</span>\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"الاستخدام\">الاستخدام</h2>\n<p>يمكنك استخدام الإعدادات المثلى افتراضيًا.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> app = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span>()\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">use</span>(<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">secureHeaders</span>())\n</code></pre>\n<p>يمكنك كتم الترويسات (headers) غير الضرورية بضبطها على false.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> app = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span>()\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">use</span>(\n  <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;*&#x27;</span>,\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">secureHeaders</span>({\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">xFrameOptions</span>: <span class=\"hljs-literal\">false</span>,\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">xXssProtection</span>: <span class=\"hljs-literal\">false</span>,\n  })\n)\n</code></pre>\n<p>يمكنك تجاوز قيم الترويسات (headers) الافتراضية باستخدام نص.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> app = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span>()\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">use</span>(\n  <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;*&#x27;</span>,\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">secureHeaders</span>({\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">strictTransportSecurity</span>:\n      <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains; preload&#x27;</span>,\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">xFrameOptions</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;DENY&#x27;</span>,\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">xXssProtection</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;1&#x27;</span>,\n  })\n)\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"الخيارات-المدعومة\">الخيارات المدعومة</h2>\n<p>يتوافق كل خيار مع أزواج المفتاح-القيمة (Key-Value) التالية للرؤوس (headers).</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>الخيار (Option)</th>\n<th>الترويسة (Header)</th>\n<th>القيمة (Value)</th>\n<th>الافتراضي (Default)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>X-Powered-By</td>\n<td>(حذف الترويسة)</td>\n<td>True</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>contentSecurityPolicy</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/CSP\">Content-Security-Policy</a></td>\n<td>الاستخدام: <a href=\"#setting-content-security-policy\">ضبط Content-Security-Policy</a></td>\n<td>بدون إعداد</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>contentSecurityPolicyReportOnly</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Headers/Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only\">Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only</a></td>\n<td>الاستخدام: <a href=\"#setting-content-security-policy\">ضبط Content-Security-Policy</a></td>\n<td>بدون إعداد</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>trustedTypes</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Headers/Content-Security-Policy/trusted-types\">الأنواع الموثوقة (<code>Trusted Types</code>)</a></td>\n<td>الاستخدام: <a href=\"#setting-content-security-policy\">ضبط Content-Security-Policy</a></td>\n<td>بدون إعداد</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>requireTrustedTypesFor</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Headers/Content-Security-Policy/require-trusted-types-for\">طلب Trusted Types لـ</a></td>\n<td>الاستخدام: <a href=\"#setting-content-security-policy\">ضبط Content-Security-Policy</a></td>\n<td>بدون إعداد</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>crossOriginEmbedderPolicy</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Headers/Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy\">Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy</a></td>\n<td>require-corp</td>\n<td><strong>False</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>crossOriginResourcePolicy</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Headers/Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy\">Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy</a></td>\n<td>same-origin</td>\n<td>True</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>crossOriginOpenerPolicy</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Headers/Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy\">Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy</a></td>\n<td>same-origin</td>\n<td>True</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>originAgentCluster</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Headers/Origin-Agent-Cluster\">Origin-Agent-Cluster</a></td>\n<td>?1</td>\n<td>True</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>referrerPolicy</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Headers/Referrer-Policy\">Referrer-Policy</a></td>\n<td>no-referrer</td>\n<td>True</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>reportingEndpoints</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.w3.org/TR/reporting-1/#header\">Reporting-Endpoints</a></td>\n<td>الاستخدام: <a href=\"#setting-content-security-policy\">ضبط Content-Security-Policy</a></td>\n<td>بدون إعداد</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>reportTo</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Headers/Content-Security-Policy/report-to\">Report-To</a></td>\n<td>الاستخدام: <a href=\"#setting-content-security-policy\">ضبط Content-Security-Policy</a></td>\n<td>بدون إعداد</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>strictTransportSecurity</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Headers/Strict-Transport-Security\">Strict-Transport-Security</a></td>\n<td>max-age=15552000; includeSubDomains</td>\n<td>True</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>xContentTypeOptions</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Headers/X-Content-Type-Options\">X-Content-Type-Options</a></td>\n<td>nosniff</td>\n<td>True</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>xDnsPrefetchControl</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Headers/X-DNS-Prefetch-Control\">X-DNS-Prefetch-Control</a></td>\n<td>off</td>\n<td>True</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>xDownloadOptions</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/archive/blogs/ie/ie8-security-part-v-comprehensive-protection#mime-handling-force-save\">X-Download-Options</a></td>\n<td>noopen</td>\n<td>True</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>xFrameOptions</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Headers/X-Frame-Options\">X-Frame-Options</a></td>\n<td>SAMEORIGIN</td>\n<td>True</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>xPermittedCrossDomainPolicies</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Headers/X-Permitted-Cross-Domain-Policies\">X-Permitted-Cross-Domain-Policies</a></td>\n<td>none</td>\n<td>True</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>xXssProtection</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Headers/X-XSS-Protection\">X-XSS-Protection</a></td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>True</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>permissionPolicy</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Headers/Permissions-Policy\">Permissions-Policy</a></td>\n<td>الاستخدام: <a href=\"#setting-permission-policy\">تعيين Permission-Policy</a></td>\n<td>بدون إعداد</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2 id=\"تعارض-البرمجيات-الوسيطة\">تعارض البرمجيات الوسيطة</h2>\n<p>يرجى توخي الحذر بشأن ترتيب المواصفة عند التعامل مع وسائط تتعامل مع نفس الترويسة (header).</p>\n<p>في هذه الحالة، يعمل Secure-headers و <code>x-powered-by</code> يتم حذفه:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> app = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span>()\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">use</span>(<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">secureHeaders</span>())\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">use</span>(<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">poweredBy</span>())\n</code></pre>\n<p>في هذه الحالة، يعمل Powered-By و <code>x-powered-by</code> يُضاف:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> app = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span>()\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">use</span>(<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">poweredBy</span>())\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">use</span>(<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">secureHeaders</span>())\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"ضبط-content-security-policy\">ضبط Content-Security-Policy</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> app = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span>()\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">use</span>(\n  <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/test&#x27;</span>,\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">secureHeaders</span>({\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">reportingEndpoints</span>: [\n      {\n        <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;endpoint-1&#x27;</span>,\n        <span class=\"hljs-attr\">url</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;https://example.com/reports&#x27;</span>,\n      },\n    ],\n    <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// -- or alternatively</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// reportTo: [</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-comment\">//   {</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-comment\">//     group: &#x27;endpoint-1&#x27;,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-comment\">//     max_age: 10886400,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-comment\">//     endpoints: [{ url: &#x27;https://example.com/reports&#x27; }],</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-comment\">//   },</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// ],</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">contentSecurityPolicy</span>: {\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">defaultSrc</span>: [<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;&#x27;self&#x27;&quot;</span>],\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">baseUri</span>: [<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;&#x27;self&#x27;&quot;</span>],\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">childSrc</span>: [<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;&#x27;self&#x27;&quot;</span>],\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">connectSrc</span>: [<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;&#x27;self&#x27;&quot;</span>],\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">fontSrc</span>: [<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;&#x27;self&#x27;&quot;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;https:&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;data:&#x27;</span>],\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">formAction</span>: [<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;&#x27;self&#x27;&quot;</span>],\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">frameAncestors</span>: [<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;&#x27;self&#x27;&quot;</span>],\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">frameSrc</span>: [<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;&#x27;self&#x27;&quot;</span>],\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">imgSrc</span>: [<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;&#x27;self&#x27;&quot;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;data:&#x27;</span>],\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">manifestSrc</span>: [<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;&#x27;self&#x27;&quot;</span>],\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">mediaSrc</span>: [<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;&#x27;self&#x27;&quot;</span>],\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">objectSrc</span>: [<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;&#x27;none&#x27;&quot;</span>],\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">reportTo</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;endpoint-1&#x27;</span>,\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">reportUri</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/csp-report&#x27;</span>,\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">sandbox</span>: [<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;allow-same-origin&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;allow-scripts&#x27;</span>],\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">scriptSrc</span>: [<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;&#x27;self&#x27;&quot;</span>],\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">scriptSrcAttr</span>: [<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;&#x27;none&#x27;&quot;</span>],\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">scriptSrcElem</span>: [<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;&#x27;self&#x27;&quot;</span>],\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">styleSrc</span>: [<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;&#x27;self&#x27;&quot;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;https:&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;&#x27;unsafe-inline&#x27;&quot;</span>],\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">styleSrcAttr</span>: [<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;none&#x27;</span>],\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">styleSrcElem</span>: [<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;&#x27;self&#x27;&quot;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;https:&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;&#x27;unsafe-inline&#x27;&quot;</span>],\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">upgradeInsecureRequests</span>: [],\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">workerSrc</span>: [<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;&#x27;self&#x27;&quot;</span>],\n    },\n  })\n)\n</code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"nonce-السمة\"><code>nonce</code> السمة</h3>\n<p>يمكنك إضافة <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Global_attributes/nonce\"><code>nonce</code> السمة</a> إلى <code>script</code> أو <code>style</code> العنصر بإضافة <code>NONCE</code> مستوردة من <code>hono/secure-headers</code> إلى <code>scriptSrc</code> أو <code>styleSrc</code>:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-tsx\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { secureHeaders, <span class=\"hljs-variable constant_\">NONCE</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono/secure-headers&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">SecureHeadersVariables</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono/secure-headers&#x27;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Specify the variable types to infer the `c.get(&#x27;secureHeadersNonce&#x27;)`:</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Variables</span> = <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">SecureHeadersVariables</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> app = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span>&lt;{ <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Variables</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Variables</span> }&gt;()\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Set the pre-defined nonce value to `scriptSrc`:</span>\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(\n  <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;*&#x27;</span>,\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">secureHeaders</span>({\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">contentSecurityPolicy</span>: {\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">scriptSrc</span>: [<span class=\"hljs-variable constant_\">NONCE</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;https://allowed1.example.com&#x27;</span>],\n    },\n  })\n)\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Get the value from `c.get(&#x27;secureHeadersNonce&#x27;)`:</span>\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">html</span>(\n    \n      <span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">body</span>&gt;</span>\n        {/** contents */}\n        <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">script</span>\n          <span class=\"hljs-attr\">src</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/js/client.js&#x27;</span>\n          <span class=\"hljs-attr\">nonce</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">{c.get(</span>&#x27;<span class=\"hljs-attr\">secureHeadersNonce</span>&#x27;)}\n        /&gt;</span><span class=\"language-javascript\">\n      &lt;/body&gt;</span></span>\n    \n  )\n})\n</code></pre>\n<p>إذا كنت تريد توليد قيمة nonce بنفسك، يمكنك أيضًا تحديد دالة كما يلي:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-tsx\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> app = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span>&lt;{\n  <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Variables</span>: { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">myNonce</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span> }\n}&gt;()\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">myNonceGenerator</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ContentSecurityPolicyOptionHandler</span> = <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// This function is called on every request.</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> nonce = <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Math</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">random</span>().<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">toString</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">36</span>).<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">slice</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span>)\n  c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">set</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;myNonce&#x27;</span>, nonce)\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">`&#x27;nonce-<span class=\"hljs-subst\">${nonce}</span>&#x27;`</span>\n}\n\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(\n  <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;*&#x27;</span>,\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">secureHeaders</span>({\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">contentSecurityPolicy</span>: {\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">scriptSrc</span>: [myNonceGenerator, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;https://allowed1.example.com&#x27;</span>],\n    },\n  })\n)\n\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">html</span>(\n    \n      <span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">body</span>&gt;</span>\n        {/** contents */}\n        <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">script</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">src</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/js/client.js&#x27;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">nonce</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">{c.get(</span>&#x27;<span class=\"hljs-attr\">myNonce</span>&#x27;)} /&gt;</span><span class=\"language-javascript\">\n      &lt;/body&gt;</span></span>\n    \n  )\n})\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"ضبط-permission-policy\">ضبط Permission-Policy</h2>\n<p>تسمح لك ترويسة Permission-Policy بالتحكم في الميزات وواجهات البرمجة (APIs) التي يمكن استخدامها في المتصفح. إليك مثالًا على كيفية تعيينها:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> app = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span>()\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">use</span>(\n  <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;*&#x27;</span>,\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">secureHeaders</span>({\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">permissionsPolicy</span>: {\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">fullscreen</span>: [<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;self&#x27;</span>], <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// fullscreen=(self)</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">bluetooth</span>: [<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;none&#x27;</span>], <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// bluetooth=(none)</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">payment</span>: [<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;self&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;https://example.com&#x27;</span>], <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// payment=(self &quot;https://example.com&quot;)</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">syncXhr</span>: [], <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// sync-xhr=()</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">camera</span>: <span class=\"hljs-literal\">false</span>, <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// camera=none</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">microphone</span>: <span class=\"hljs-literal\">true</span>, <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// microphone=*</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">geolocation</span>: [<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;*&#x27;</span>], <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// geolocation=*</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">usb</span>: [<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;self&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;https://a.example.com&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;https://b.example.com&#x27;</span>], <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// usb=(self &quot;https://a.example.com&quot; &quot;https://b.example.com&quot;)</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">accelerometer</span>: [<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;https://*.example.com&#x27;</span>], <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// accelerometer=(&quot;https://*.example.com&quot;)</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">gyroscope</span>: [<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;src&#x27;</span>], <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// gyroscope=(src)</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">magnetometer</span>: [\n        <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;https://a.example.com&#x27;</span>,\n        <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;https://b.example.com&#x27;</span>,\n      ], <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// magnetometer=(&quot;https://a.example.com&quot; &quot;https://b.example.com&quot;)</span>\n    },\n  })\n)\n</code></pre>\n"}